  user_input {
    user_response: "I need an app similar to this but able to use my own teach program for any language practice. Like Serbian. It should be able to import dictionary and lessons from custom  XML, CSV or JSON files. Call the app Language Learner, featuring an offline mode for seamless practice anytime. It should include spaced repetition algorithms and support audio file integration.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/Polyglot_Language_Learning_App_-_Functional_Specification___System_Description_9f236393 (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/Polyglot_Language_Learning_App_-_Functional_Specification___System_Description_9f236393). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/Polyglot_Language_Learning_App_-_Functional_Specification___System_Description_9f236393. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/Screenshot_20261106_110326_7878c5b6.jpg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/Screenshot_20261106_110326_7878c5b6.jpg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/Screenshot_20261106_110326_7878c5b6.jpg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/Screenshot_20261106_110331_753920e2.jpg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/Screenshot_20261106_110331_753920e2.jpg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/Screenshot_20261106_110331_753920e2.jpg. W