  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Phase One Rules**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the Phase 1 rules, specifically the Interactive Clarification & Interview aspect. I\'m noting the conditions that trigger this phase, like when planning mode is active or when prompts include specific metadata requesting a plan or design. I\'m trying to solidify the conditions that indicate when this turn will be triggered.\n\n\n**Refining Clarification Approach**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the clarification question mechanism. I\'m focusing on the `ask_question` tool specifically. I\'m noting the importance of plain text formatting for questions and options, ensuring conciseness and clarity to avoid unnecessary verbosity. Also, I\'m aiming for 2-6 options and short questions. I will not output or draft the implementation plan yet.\n\n\n**Adjusting Question Strategy**\n\nI\'m now revising my clarification questions, removing the \"Other\" option entirely. I\'ve also incorporated a \"(Recommended)\" prefix to guide the user\'s responses. I\'m carefully considering how to frame the questions, and the formatting of the options, ensuring they are direct and user-friendly. I will present the user with a starter curriculum and audio option.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14758682824916908856"
      name: "ask_question"
      arguments_json: "{\"questions\":[{\"is_multi_select\":false,\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Serbian with 16 polyglot grammar lessons\",\"English for Russian speakers as in screenshots\",\"Blank template with importer ready\"],\"question\":\"Which default language curriculum should be preloaded for immediate offline practice?\"},{\"is_multi_select\":false,\"options\":[\"(Recommended) System Text-to-Speech plus custom audio file mapping\",\"Custom imported audio files only\",\"Device Text-to-Speech engine only\"],\"question\":\"How would you like audio pronunciation to be handled for offline study?\"},{\"is_multi_select\":false,\"options\":[\"(Recommended) High-contrast dark theme matching the screenshots\",\"Modern Material 3 with both dark and light modes\",\"Minimalist slate and indigo light theme\"],\"question\":\"What visual theme style would you prefer for the app interface?\"}],\"toolAction\":\"Asking clarifying questions\",\"toolSummary\":\"Clarifying preferences\"}"
