    thinking: "**Examining Implementation Path**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing the artifact directory path details for creating the implementation plan. I\'ve noted the specified path: `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/307b4e51-0cdc-4918-96ee-c90ad2253c38`. Further path details are being observed as part of the analysis for a comprehensive implementation strategy.\n\n\n**Defining Plan Parameters**\n\nI\'ve defined the parameters for `write_to_file`. The `TargetFile` is set, and I\'ve populated `ArtifactMetadata` with request feedback, user-facing details, and a comprehensive summary of the plan\'s contents, including the application features. I\'ve also set the overwrite flag, and the implementation plan is ready for review.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12175941909842535029"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for Language Learner: an offline-first Android application modeled on the Polyglot 16 methodology, configured for Serbian (B1 focus for Russian speakers) with extensible XML/CSV/JSON lesson & dictionary importing, spaced repetition scheduling, 3x3 grammar conjugation matrices, tile-unscrambling sentence practice, multiple-choice vocabulary drills, and dual audio support (TTS + custom audio files).\",\"UserFacing\":true},\"CodeContent\":\"# Language Learner \342\200\224 Custom Curriculum & Offline Practice (Polyglot Method)\\n\\nLanguage Learner is an offline-first Android application inspired by the proven Polyglot 16 methodology, designed to teach languages through systematic grammar automation, lexical acquisition, and active sentence synthesis. The app comes pre-packaged with a rich Serbian language curriculum for Russian speakers (B1 grammar level) while giving users complete freedom to import custom lessons, dictionaries, and audio mappings via XML, CSV, or JSON.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The following product configurations were confirmed in Phase 1 clarification:\\n> - **Preloaded Curriculum**: Serbian for Russian speakers targeting intermediate/B1 grammar patterns (Past/Present/Future verb forms, reflexive verbs with *se*, modal constructions with *da*, aspectual pairs, and case government in daily context).\\n> - **Audio Engine**: Dual audio pipeline combining device Android Text-to-Speech (TTS) for instant pronunciation with custom local audio file mapping (URI / file associations) for authentic native recordings.\\n> - **Visual Identity**: Modern Material 3 theme supporting dynamic Dark and Light modes with deep slate surfaces, vibrant emerald success indicators, coral alerts, and electric indigo interactive accents.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Does**: \\n  - Provides a structured lesson hierarchy (Lessons 1\342\200\22316+) following the Polyglot method.\\n  - Features a dedicated **Vocabulary Drill Module** (2x2 matching drills with instantaneous visual/haptic feedback).\\n  - Features an interactive **3x3 Verb Conjugation Matrix** viewer (Form: Affirmative / Negative / Interrogative \303\227 Tense: Past / Present / Future).\\n  - Features an **Interactive Sentence Unscrambler** with word tiles, distractor chips, and syntactic validation.\\n  - Implements **Spaced Repetition (SM-2 variant)** tracking ease factor, repetition count, and next review timestamps for difficult words and sentences.\\n  - Supports **Custom Curriculum Import**: One-tap parsing of user-supplied JSON, CSV, or XML files for custom dictionaries, vocabulary decks, grammar tables, and sentence exercises, plus exporting sample templates.\\n  - **100% Offline Capable**: All data is stored locally in Room database; TTS and cached audio files run without requiring internet access.\\n\\n- **Target Audience**:\\n  - Independent learners targeting Serbian (and any other language through custom decks) who prefer structural mechanics, grammar reflexes, and deliberate sentence construction over casual gamification.\\n\\n- **Key Value**:\\n  - Eliminates reliance on rigid proprietary apps by giving users ownership of their curriculum files while delivering the polished, fast-paced drill mechanics of the Polyglot 16 system.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n#### Key User Flows\\n1. **Curriculum Stream & Lesson Hub**:\\n   - The user opens the app to a clean list of lessons with progress rings, mastery score badges, and sub-module shortcuts: *Vocabulary Drills*, *Grammar Matrix*, and *Sentence Practice*.\\n   - A top app bar provides tabs or shortcuts for **Lessons**, **Spaced Repetition Review (Due Queue)**, and **Dictionary / Import**.\\n2. **Vocabulary Matching Drill**:\\n   - Prominently displays the target word (e.g., Serbian *\342\200\236\321\200\320\260\320\267\320\263\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\200\320\260\321\202\320\270\342\200\234* or *\342\200\236\321\200\320\260\320\264\320\270\321\202\320\270\342\200\234*) with phonetic/grammar info.\\n   - 2x2 grid of translation cards in Russian.\\n   - Tapping the speaker icon plays native audio or TTS.\\n   - Instant emerald pulse on correct answer; shake animation and coral highlight on error with queue re-insertion.\\n3. **Grammar Matrix & Reference**:\\n   - Interactive 3x3 conjugation grid that clearly breaks down auxiliary verb placement, pronoun agreement, and suffix shifts across Past, Present, and Future.\\n   - Tapping cells reveals example sentences and explanatory usage notes.\\n4. **Sentence Construction (Tile Unscrambler)**:\\n   - Source sentence presented (e.g., Russian: *\342\200\236\320\242\321\213 \320\277\320\276\320\271\320\264\321\221\321\210\321\214 \320\267\320\260\320\262\321\202\321\200\320\260 \320\262 \320\272\320\270\320\275\320\276?\342\200\234*).\\n   - User builds the target translation (Serbian: *\342\200\236\320\245\320\276\321\233\320\265\321\210 \320\273\320\270 \320\270\321\233\320\270 \321\201\321\203\321\202\321\200\320\260 \321\203 \320\261\320\270\320\276\321\201\320\272\320\276\320\277?\342\200\234*) by tapping word chips into the assembly bay.\\n   - Real-time removal on tap, distractor chips, and one-tap audio playback.\\n5. **Custom Curriculum Importer**:\\n   - Dedicated import screen allowing users to pick an XML, CSV, or JSON file from device storage, or load pre-bundled templates.\\n   - Validation summary (e.g., *\\\"Successfully loaded 18 lessons and 240 vocabulary items\\\"*).\\n   - Ability to associate audio folders or files with curriculum entries.\\n\\n#### Visual Identity & Theme Tokens\\n- **Design System**: Material Design 3 with custom high-contrast surface hierarchy.\\n- **Dark Mode Palette**:\\n  - Surface & Background: Deep Slate `#0B0F19` and `#111827`\\n  - Cards & Containers: `#1F2937` with subtle `#374151` borders\\n  - Primary Accent: Indigo `#6366F1`\\n  - Success Indicator: Emerald `#10B981`\\n  - Error / Alert: Coral `#EF4444`\\n  - Text Primary: `#F9FAFB` | Text Secondary: `#9CA3AF`\\n- **Light Mode Palette**:\\n  - Surface & Background: Clean Crisp White `#F8FAFC`\\n  - Cards: `#FFFFFF` with `#E2E8F0` outlines\\n  - Primary Accent: Indigo `#4F46E5`\\n  - Text Primary: `#0F172A` | Text Secondary: `#64748B`\\n- **Typography & Ergonomics**:\\n  - Prominent readable typography for Cyrillic and Latin scripts (Serbian uses both Cyrillic and Latin alphabets; support toggle or bilingual view).\\n  - All interactive tiles and buttons adhere to a minimum 48dp \303\227 48dp touch target.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: Persistence Strategy via Room Database**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Use Room (SQLite) with pre-populated B1 Serbian curriculum and relational tables for Lessons, Vocabulary, Grammar Guides, Sentences, and Review Logs.\\n  - *Why*: Room provides strict typing, lightning-fast reactive Flow queries, seamless offline operation, and rapid updates when importing external files.\\n  - *Trade-off*: Fully offline and private to the device without requiring cloud authentication or network dependencies.\\n- **Decision 2: Comprehensive Multi-Format File Importer (JSON, CSV, XML)**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Build dedicated parsers for JSON (via Moshi/Kotlinx Serialization), CSV (buffered streaming), and XML (Android `XmlPullParser`).\\n  - *Why*: Language teachers and learners use different formats (Anki CSV exports, custom XML course packs, or structured JSON). Providing all three ensures zero friction.\\n- **Decision 3: Audio Architecture (TTS + File System URIs)**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: `AudioPlayerManager` that attempts to play local audio URI if specified; falls back gracefully to `TextToSpeech` with language locale configuration.\\n  - *Why*: Guarantees pronunciation works out of the box on any device while offering high fidelity for custom audio files.\\n- **Decision 4: Spaced Repetition Algorithm**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: An adapted SM-2 spaced repetition calculation storing `interval`, `repetitionCount`, `easeFactor`, and `dueDate`.\\n  - *Why*: Standardized and battle-tested for long-term vocabulary and grammar retention.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                          UI LAYER (Compose)                            \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220 \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220 \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\20