  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Checking Permissions Progress**\n\nI\'ve been examining the necessary permissions. Audio playback and TTS are thankfully straightforward, needing no runtime permissions. Reading local files is also simpler than I initially anticipated; Android\'s Storage Access Framework offers a solution via `ActivityResultContracts.OpenDocument` or `GetContent`, which require no broad storage permissions.\n\n\n**Adding Vibrate Permission**\n\nI\'ve added the `android.permission.VIBRATE` declaration in `AndroidManifest.xml` for haptic feedback, a small but important addition for drill interaction. Moving on, I\'m setting up the app icon generation process next! I\'m planning to use a `generate_image` tool per the guidelines to create a custom foreground asset, based on the app\'s functionality description, and not use a transparent background. I will explicitly set a hex color background.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9229623767877769299"
