  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting Build Configuration**\n\nI\'ve been looking over the build configuration, specifically the `app/build.gradle.kts` file. I see that Room is already set up with `ktx`, `runtime`, and `compiler` dependencies. Also, Moshi\'s Kotlin library appears present.\n\n\n**Confirming Core Libraries**\n\nI\'ve confirmed that `libs.converter.moshi` and `ksp(libs.moshi.kotlin.codegen)` are included. Moreover, Compose Material 3 dependencies (`libs.androidx.compose.material3`, `libs.androidx.compose.material.icons.extended`) are present. Standard Android libraries for Text-to-Speech, MediaPlayer, XML and CSV parsing are planned to be used.\n\nI\'m starting to visualize the data architecture, beginning with modular file designs. I\'m placing Room entities, such as `Lesson.kt` and `VocabItem.kt`, under `data/model/`, while the Data Access Objects (DAOs) and database itself will reside under the `data/local/` directory.\n\n\n\n**Outlining Feature Components**\n\nI\'m now outlining key feature components and their directory structures. I plan to use `CurriculumImporter.kt` to handle JSON, CSV, and XML data, including export templates. The `CurriculumRepository.kt` will sit in data/repository/, and the `AudioController.kt` will handle TTS. I\'ll use the SM-2 algorithm for spaced repetition, and I am establishing UI design with themes. Screens for Curriculum, Lessons, Vocab Drills, and Grammar Matrix are also coming together.\n\n\n**Defining Data Entities**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the data entities. I plan to start with `Entities.kt` under `com.example.data.model`, and I\'ll consider how these entities relate to the user interface and data structures. I\'ll need to consider how to handle various data formats, user interactions, and specific Serbian B1 lessons that need to be captured.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12440969581676426438"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.data.model\\n\\nimport androidx.room.Entity\\nimport androidx.room.ForeignKey\\nimport androidx.room.Index\\nimport androidx.room.PrimaryKey\\n\\n@Entity(tableName = \\\"lessons\\\")\\ndata class LessonEntity(\\n    @PrimaryKey val id: String,\\n    val orderIndex: Int,\\n    val title: String,\\n    val subtitle: String,\\n    val grammarFocus: String,\\n    val level: String = \\\"B1\\\",\\n    val isCompleted: Boolean = false,\\n    val masteryScore: Float = 0f, // 0.0 - 5.0\\n    val vocabCount: Int = 0,\\n    val sentenceCount: Int = 0\\n)\\n\\n@Entity(\\n    tableName = \\\"vocab_items\\\",\\n    foreignKeys = [\\n        ForeignKey(\\n            entity = LessonEntity::class,\\n            parentColumns = [\\\"id\\\"],\\n            childColumns = [\\\"lessonId\\\"],\\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\\n        )\\n    ],\\n    indices = [Index(\\\"lessonId\\\")]\\n)\\ndata class VocabItemEntity(\\n    @PrimaryKey val id: String,\\n    val lessonId: String,\\n    val targetWord: String,       // Serbian (e.g., \\\"\321\200\320\260\320\267\320\263\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\200\320\260\321\202\320\270\\\")\\n    val targetWordLatin: String,  // Serbian Latin script (e.g., \\\"razgovarati\\\")\\n    val sourceTranslation: String,// Russian (e.g., \\\"\321\200\320\260\320\267\320\263\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\200\320\270\320\262\320\260\321\202\321\214\\\")\\n    val partOfSpeech: String,     // Verb, Noun, Adj, etc.\\n    val phonetic: String = \\\"\\\",\\n    val exampleSentence: String = \\\"\\\",\\n    val distractorsJson: String = \\\"[]\\\", // List of false choices for 2x2 drills\\n    val audioUri: String = \\\"\\\"     // Local file path or custom URI\\n)\\n\\n@Entity(\\n    tableName = \\\"grammar_guides\\\",\\n    foreignKeys = [\\n        ForeignKey(\\n            entity = LessonEntity::class,\\n            parentColumns = [\\\"id\\\"],\\n            childColumns = [\\\"lessonId\\\"],\\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\\n        )\\n    ],\\n    indices = [Index(\\\"lessonId\\\")]\\n)\\ndata class GrammarGuideEntity(\\n    @PrimaryKey val id: String,\\n    val lessonId: String,\\n    val title: String,\\n    val summary: String,\\n    val explanationMarkdown: String,\\n    val matrixJson: String // Serialized 3x3 conjugation matrix\\n)\\n\\n@Entity(\\n    tableName = \\\"sentences\\\",\\n    foreignKeys = [\\n        ForeignKey(\\n            entity = LessonEntity::class,\\n            parentColumns = [\\\"id\\\"],\\n            childColumns = [\\\"lessonId\\\"],\\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\\n        )\\n    ],\\n    indices = [Index(\\\"lessonId\\\")]\\n)\\ndata class SentenceEntity(\\n    @PrimaryKey val id: String,\\n    val lessonId: String,\\n    val sourceSentence: String,       // Prompt in Russian: \\\"\320\242\321\213 \320\277\320\276\320\271\320\264\321\221\321\210\321\214 \320\267\320\260\320\262\321\202\321\200\320\260 \320\262 \320\272\320\270\320\275\320\276?\\\"\\n    val targetSentence: String,       // Serbian: \\\"\320\245\320\276\321\233\320\265\321\210 \320\273\320\270 \320\270\321\233\320\270 \321\201\321\203\321\202\321\200\320\260 \321\203 \320\261\320\270\320\276\321\201\320\272\320\276\320\277?\\\"\\n    val targetSentenceLatin: String,  // \\\"Ho\304\207e\305\241 li i\304\207i sutra u bioskop?\\\"\\n    val tokensJson: String,           // Correct tokens: [\\\"\320\245\320\276\321\233\320\265\321\210\\\", \\\"\320\273\320\270\\\", \\\"\320\270\321\233\320\270\\\", \\\"\321\201\321\203\321\202\321\200\320\260\\\", \\\"\321\203\\\", \\\"\320\261\320\270\320\276\321\201\320\272\320\276\320\277?\\\"]\\n    val distractorTokensJson: String, // Distractor tokens: [\\\"\321\230\320\265\321\201\320\270\\\", \\\"\320\276\321\202\320\270\321\210\320\260\320\276\\\", \\\"\321\201\321\203\321\202\321\200\320\260\320\264\320\260\320\275\\\"]\\n    val grammarHint: String = \\\"\\\",\\n    val audioUri: String = \\\"\\\"\\n)\\n\\n@Entity(tableName = \\\"srs_reviews\\\")\\ndata class SrsReviewEntity(\\n    @PrimaryKey val id: String,       // Matches vocab or sentence id\\n    val itemType: String,             // \\\"VOCAB\\\" or \\\"SENTENCE\\\"\\n    val lessonId: String,\\n    val prompt: String,\\n    val answer: String,\\n    val secondaryText: String = \\\"\\\",\\n    val repetition: Int = 0,\\n    val intervalDays: Int = 1,\\n    val easeFactor: Float = 2.5f,     // SM-2 default ease factor\\n    val nextReviewTimestamp: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\\n    val lastQuality: Int = 0          // 0 to 5\\n)\\n\",\"Description\":\"Room data entities for Lessons, Vocabulary, Grammar Guides, Sentences, and Spaced Repetition items\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/Entities.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating model entities\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create Room entities\"}"
