  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Curriculum Data**\n\nI\'m now generating initial curriculum data. The focus is a B1 Serbian curriculum for Russian speakers, emphasizing authentic grammar. I\'m leveraging Polyglot 16 matrixes to structure the lessons.\n\n\n**Outlining Language Structure**\n\nI\'ve sketched out the initial lesson sequence. I\'m starting with Present tense conjugation using the verb \"\320\240\320\260\320\264\320\270\321\202\320\270,\" employing a 3x3 matrix to cover Affirmative, Negative, and Interrogative forms in Past, Present, and Future tenses. Next, I\'ll dive into reflexive verbs with \"\320\241\320\225,\" followed by modal constructions and past tenses. Future tense forms and verb aspect pairs will complete the initial topics.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7404194749114186065"
      name: "write_to_file"
