  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining ImportExportScreen**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the `ImportExportScreen.kt` component. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of file import functionality. I plan to use `ActivityResultContracts.GetContent` (or `OpenDocument`) for device storage access, specifying MIME types for JSON, XML, CSV, and plain text. I\'ll also handle raw XML input via paste.\n\n\n"
