    thinking: "**Awaiting Task Completion**\n\nI\'m currently on hold, waiting for task-117 to finish before moving forward. Once that\'s done, my next step is a thorough review of everything, making sure the \"Language Learner\" app, including the name appearing in `metadata.json`, `strings.xml`, and `settings.gradle.kts`, and custom adaptive launcher icon fully comply with the user\'s instructions.\n\n\n**Defining App Features**\n\nI\'ve been occupied defining core app features. I\'m focusing on offline functionality using a local Room database with a pre-loaded Serbian B1 curriculum for Russian speakers. I\'m also planning the custom curriculum importer, handling various file formats from local storage. My design includes a Spaced Repetition system (SM-2), an interactive verb conjugation matrix, a sentence practice engine, and vocabulary drill with dual audio support.\n\n\n"
