  planner_response {
    response: "### Language Learner Application Overview\n\nThe **Language Learner** Android application is built with complete offline capability, extensible curriculum importing, and the pedagogical structure of the Polyglot 16 methodology.\n\n---\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n1. **Preloaded B1 Serbian Curriculum (for Russian Speakers)**:\n   - Covers core B1 grammatical structures: regular present tense conjugations, reflexive verbs with *\321\201\320\265*, modal constructions (*\321\205\321\202\320\265\321\202\320\270 / \320\274\320\276\321\233\320\270 / \320\274\320\276\321\200\320\260\321\202\320\270 + \320\264\320\260 + \320\277\321\200\320\265\320\267\320\265\320\275\321\202*), perfect past tense with auxiliary *\320\261\320\270\321\202\320\270*, future tense (*\321\204\321\203\321\202\321\203\321\200 I*), and verbal aspects.\n   - One-tap script toggle between Cyrillic (*\320\213\320\270\321\200\320\270\320\273\320\270\321\206\320\260*) and Latin (*Latinica*).\n\n2. **Interactive 3x3 Verb Conjugation Matrix**:\n   - 3\303\2273 matrix mapping sentence forms (**Affirmative [+]**, **Negative [\342\200\223]**, **Interrogative [?]**) across tenses (**Past**, **Present**, **Future**).\n   - Tapping any cell expands detailed grammatical formulas, bilingual examples, and pronunciation playback.\n\n3. **Vocabulary Acquisition & Matching Drills**:\n   - 2-column translation drills with instant Emerald Green / Coral Red haptic and visual feedback.\n   - Audio pronunciation of target words and auto-requeueing of missed terms for reinforcement.\n\n4. **Interactive Sentence Construction**:\n   - Active sentence unscrambling with source prompt in Russian and target assembly in Serbian.\n   - Word tile pool with distractor chips, sequential placement, tap-to-remove assembly bay, and multi-segment visual progress indicator.\n\n5. **Spaced Repetition System (SM-2)**:\n   - Dedicated review tab tracking recall intervals, ease factors, and due dates.\n   - 4-grade evaluation options (**Again**, **Hard**, **Good**, **Easy**) updating the review queue offline.\n\n6. **Custom XML, CSV, & JSON Curriculum Importer**:\n   - Full support for importing custom teaching programs and vocabulary decks from device storage (via Android SAF) or direct text pasting.\n   - Built-in downloadable/copyable templates for XML, CSV, and JSON formats.\n   - Safe reset button to restore default B1 Serbian lessons at any time.\n\n7. **Dual Audio Support**:\n   - Android Text-to-Speech (TTS) integration with locale fallback for native Serbian pronunciation.\n   - Integrated custom audio file playback (`MediaPlayer`) when specific audio URIs are supplied in imported curriculum files.\n\n8. **Theme & Polish**:\n   - Modern Material 3 interface with dynamic Dark Mode and Light Mode toggle.\n   - Custom adaptive launcher icon with glowing grammar matrix and dialogue book design."
    modified_response: "### Language Learner Application Overview\n\nThe **Language Learner** Android application is built with complete offline capability, extensible curriculum importing, and the pedagogical structure of the Polyglot 16 methodology.\n\n---\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n1. **Preloaded B1 Serbian Curriculum (for Russian Speakers)**:\n   - Covers core B1 grammatical structures: regular present tense conjugations, reflexive verbs with *\321\201\320\265*, modal constructions (*\321\205\321\202\320\265\321\202\320\270 / \320\274\320\276\321\233\320\270 / \320\274\320\276\321\200\320\260\321\202\320\270 + \320\264\320\260 + \320\277\321\200\320\265\320\267\320\265\320\275\321\202*), perfect past tense with auxiliary *\320\261\320\270\321\202\320\270*, future tense (*\321\204\321\203\321\202\321\203\321\200 I*), and verbal aspects.\n   - One-tap script toggle between Cyrillic (*\320\213\320\270\321\200\320\270\320\273\320\270\321\206\320\260*) and Latin (*Latinica*).\n\n2. **Interactive 3x3 Verb Conjugation Matrix**:\n   - 3\303\2273 matrix mapping sentence forms (**Affirmative [+]**, **Negative [\342\200\223]**, **Interrogative [?]**) across tenses (**Past**, **Present**, **Future**).\n   - Tapping any cell expands detailed grammatical formulas, bilingual examples, and pronunciation playback.\n\n3. **Vocabulary Acquisition & Matching Drills**:\n   - 2-column translation drills with instant Emerald Green / Coral Red haptic and visual feedback.\n   - Audio pronunciation of target words and auto-requeueing of missed terms for reinforcement.\n\n4. **Interactive Sentence Construction**:\n   - Active sentence unscrambling with source prompt in Russian and target assembly in Serbian.\n   - Word tile pool with distractor chips, sequential placement, tap-to-remove assembly bay, and multi-segment visual progress indicator.\n\n5. **Spaced Repetition System (SM-2)**:\n   - Dedicated review tab tracking recall intervals, ease factors, and due dates.\n   - 4-grade evaluation options (**Again**, **Hard**, **Good**, **Easy**) updating the review queue offline.\n\n6. **Custom XML, CSV, & JSON Curriculum Importer**:\n   - Full support for importing custom teaching programs and vocabulary decks from device storage (via Android SAF) or direct text pasting.\n   - Built-in downloadable/copyable templates for XML, CSV, and JSON formats.\n   - Safe reset button to restore default B1 Serbian lessons at any time.\n\n7. **Dual Audio Support**:\n   - Android Text-to-Speech (TTS) integration with locale fallback for native Serbian pronunciation.\n   - Integrated custom audio file playback (`MediaPlayer`) when specific audio URIs are supplied in imported curriculum files.\n\n8. **Theme & Polish**:\n   - Modern Material 3 interface with dynamic Dark Mode and Light Mode toggle.\n   - Custom adaptive launcher icon with glowing grammar matrix and dialogue book design."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\315\003\n\312\003\001i\024}\023\377\233\200\t\030<XT\036\212\325\222v\315\237\352\265T\305\b\264\314\212\365\376\342c\177+\331A\206\330\326Q~^\r\222\230\343u\302m I\276\2669u\320\232\217\036\353\232\325\021\036\336\250\262\224\230\271\277\376\376\303\'\306\336\206\362\206j\320\317S\300u\254\251\245\221\037\347\352\v\025\'\204%*R3#j\263\365^\246\347\335?\006R\333O\301\223\247-\311\315\242W[\230\332\0174\n2r\372\n\251=\244&\271\032\265\321\\I4\342\000v.R\336\370t\026\0258\251x\274`\363&;\264\355\267\211B\2517\004\266\331\204\3651Q\373?\376\240\266\376\337\201\222\320\262\236.\332\211\323\035%s;\000\362\337\377\225Y:zk*\217\244\342\370\237\254p\322\2048\207r\020`\353\360\323\333\341\3617\271i\360\310\356g\224\316x\tm\275n\323\235~\274MjD\224\b\305\201!\306\277\022\321q\213C-\031\213\350\303\350\217I\370)~\250\211\037u\303EV\277\202\023\327TR^F\242\024g\326\270\302\3131\346LV\325Z\243\025{H\303\020_\276\253\224\374\237\333\225\210+\036T\207x\330\314\273\031\316\n\f\270M\251\220\307\0341\267/\003L\221\341\2177\f\316\vSs\022&N\214@`\215\377Dz\375Y\214N\375\352?\262h\277E\311\021M\224\200\204O\217\271A0\367Q\003=\2024=\250\203\242vda\n\030ue\262\264\022\310\226Vn{\336\371G\3425\322{(\266X\276\261\021\205w\251i\355@\361q\346\260\210\254Yn\332?\270p\337\324\020\303\303{\316\333\304nM\356!\224\374\226\325\316\220gT\270`C\310\362"
