  user_input {
    user_response: "Fixes:\n1 All Lessons should have default grade 0, not 4.5. The grade should be increased based on right answers, reduced if user made an error.  Based on 100 questions with 90 or more correct answers program should give 4.5 grade and unblock next lesson. Programm should keep last 100 answers. Total count ow right answers devide by 100 and multiply by 5. \n2. Program should provide correct and wrong variants of words. \n3. Program should provide only inner case words, not a word started with capital case.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Fixes:\n1 All Lessons should have default grade 0, not 4.5. The grade should be increased based on right answers, reduced if user made an error.  Based on 100 questions with 90 or more correct answers program should give 4.5 grade and unblock next lesson. Programm should keep last 100 answers. Total count ow right answers devide by 100 and multiply by 5. \n2. Program should provide correct and wrong variants of words. \n3. Program should provide only inner case words, not a word started with capital case.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
