          unified_diff {
            lines {
              text: "# Language Learner \342\200\224 Custom Curriculum & Offline Practice (Polyglot Method)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "Language Learner is an offline-first Android application inspired by the proven Polyglot 16 methodology, designed to teach languages through systematic grammar automation, lexical acquisition, and active sentence synthesis. The app comes pre-packaged with a rich Serbian language curriculum for Russian speakers (B1 grammar level) while giving users complete freedom to import custom lessons, dictionaries, and audio mappings via XML, CSV, or JSON."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "# Language Learner \342\200\224 Dynamic Grading, Lesson Unlocking & Inner-Case Word Banks"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "This update addresses three key pedagogical refinements:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Dynamic 100-Answer Grading & Progression**: All lessons initialize with a default grade of `0.0`. Every right and wrong answer in both Sentence Practice and Vocabulary Drills updates a rolling history of the user\'s last 100 answers per lesson. The grade is computed as `(right_answers / 100) * 5.0`. Reaching 90 or more correct answers yields a grade of `4.5` or higher, which officially masters the lesson and unblocks the subsequent lesson."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Morphological Word Variants (Distractors)**: Sentences and vocabulary drills will generate plausible grammatical variants (e.g., alternative tenses, numbers, grammatical cases, and near-homophones) alongside correct tokens to test active syntax mastery."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Inner-Case (Lowercase) Word Bank Tiles**: All word chips in the tile pool and assembly bay are standardized to lowercase without initial capital letters or punctuation clues, ensuring users must actively reconstruct the syntax rather than identifying the first word by capitalization."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "### User Review & Critical Decisions"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "> [!IMPORTANT]"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "> The following product configurations were confirmed in Phase 1 clarification:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Preloaded Curriculum**: Serbian for Russian speakers targeting intermediate/B1 grammar patterns (Past/Present/Future verb forms, reflexive verbs with *se*, modal constructions with *da*, aspectual pairs, and case government in daily context)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Audio Engine**: Dual audio pipeline combining device Android Text-to-Speech (TTS) for instant pronunciation with custom local audio file mapping (URI / file associations) for authentic native recordings."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Visual Identity**: Modern Material 3 theme supporting dynamic Dark and Light modes with deep slate surfaces, vibrant emerald success indicators, coral alerts, and electric indigo interactive accents."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "> The following parameters were confirmed during clarification:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Grade Scaling**: Calculated against 100 total slots from the start (`grade = (correctAnswersInLast100 / 100.0) * 5.0`). The grade begins at `0.0` and scales progressively towards `5.0`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Progression Gate**: Lesson 1 is unlocked by default. Subsequent lessons remain locked until the immediately preceding lesson achieves a grade of `4.5` (90/100 correct answers)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Input Sources**: Both Vocabulary Matching drills and Sentence Construction exercises feed into the 100-answer history."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Case Normalization**: All word chips in the sentence construction bank are strictly lowercased."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: "
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Provides a structured lesson hierarchy (Lessons 1\342\200\22316+) following the Polyglot method."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Features a dedicated **Vocabulary Drill Module** (2x2 matching drills with instantaneous visual/haptic feedback)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Features an interactive **3x3 Verb Conjugation Matrix** viewer (Form: Affirmative / Negative / Interrogative \303\227 Tense: Past / Present / Future)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Features an **Interactive Sentence Unscrambler** with word tiles, distractor chips, and syntactic validation."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Implements **Spaced Repetition (SM-2 variant)** tracking ease factor, repetition count, and next review timestamps for difficult words and sentences."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Supports **Custom Curriculum Import**: One-tap parsing of user-supplied JSON, CSV, or XML files for custom dictionaries, vocabulary decks, grammar tables, and sentence exercises, plus exporting sample templates."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **100% Offline Capable**: All data is stored locally in Room database; TTS and cached audio files run without requiring internet access."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Target Audience**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Independent learners targeting Serbian (and any other language through custom decks) who prefer structural mechanics, grammar reflexes, and deliberate sentence construction over casual gamification."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Value**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Eliminates reliance on rigid proprietary apps by giving users ownership of their curriculum files while delivering the polished, fast-paced drill mechanics of the Polyglot 16 system."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Replaces all hardcoded `4.5` ratings with real-time dynamic grades stored in Room (`LessonEntity.masteryScore`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Maintains an answer history table `lesson_answer_history` tracking the last 100 answers (`isCorrect: Boolean`) per lesson."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Computes `masteryScore = (correctCount / 100.0f) * 5.0f` on every single answer submission."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Automatically unlocks `Lesson N + 1` as soon as `Lesson N` achieves `masteryScore >= 4.5f`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Normalizes all sentence word tokens to lower-case (\"inner case\"), removing period/question mark attachments from tiles so capitalization doesn\'t hint at the sentence opener."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Enriches sentence word pools with morphological distractor variants (e.g., for *\342\200\236\321\205\320\276\321\233\321\203\342\200\234*, distractors include *\342\200\236\320\275\320\265\321\233\321\203\342\200\234*, *\342\200\236\321\205\320\276\321\233\320\265\321\210\342\200\234*, *\342\200\236\321\205\321\202\320\265\320\276\342\200\234*)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "#### Key User Flows"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Curriculum Stream & Lesson Hub**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - The user opens the app to a clean list of lessons with progress rings, mastery score badges, and sub-module shortcuts: *Vocabulary Drills*, *Grammar Matrix*, and *Sentence Practice*."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - A top app bar provides tabs or shortcuts for **Lessons**, **Spaced Repetition Review (Due Queue)**, and **Dictionary / Import**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Vocabulary Matching Drill**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Prominently displays the target word (e.g., Serbian *\342\200\236\321\200\320\260\320\267\320\263\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\200\320\260\321\202\320\270\342\200\234* or *\342\200\236\321\200\320\260\320\264\320\270\321\202\320\270\342\200\234*) with phonetic/grammar info."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - 2x2 grid of translation cards in Russian."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Tapping the speaker icon plays native audio or TTS."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Instant emerald pulse on correct answer; shake animation and coral highlight on error with queue re-insertion."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Grammar Matrix & Reference**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Interactive 3x3 conjugation grid that clearly breaks down auxiliary verb placement, pronoun agreement, and suffix shifts across Past, Present, and Future."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Tapping cells reveals example sentences and explanatory usage notes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Sentence Construction (Tile Unscrambler)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Source sentence presented (e.g., Russian: *\342\200\236\320\242\321\213 \320\277\320\276\320\271\320\264\321\221\321\210\321\214 \320\267\320\260\320\262\321\202\321\200\320\260 \320\262 \320\272\320\270\320\275\320\276?\342\200\234*)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - User builds the target translation (Serbian: *\342\200\236\320\245\320\276\321\233\320\265\321\210 \320\273\320\270 \320\270\321\233\320\270 \321\201\321\203\321\202\321\200\320\260 \321\203 \320\261\320\270\320\276\321\201\320\272\320\276\320\277?\342\200\234*) by tapping word chips into the assembly bay."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Real-time removal on tap, distractor chips, and one-tap audio playback."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Custom Curriculum Importer**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Dedicated import screen allowing users to pick an XML, CSV, or JSON file from device storage, or load pre-bundled templates."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Validation summary (e.g., *\"Successfully loaded 18 lessons and 240 vocabulary items\"*)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Ability to associate audio folders or files with curriculum entries."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "#### Visual Identity & Theme Tokens"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Design System**: Material Design 3 with custom high-contrast surface hierarchy."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Dark Mode Palette**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Surface & Background: Deep Slate `#0B0F19` and `#111827`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Cards & Containers: `#1F2937` with subtle `#374151` borders"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Primary Accent: Indigo `#6366F1`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Success Indicator: Emerald `#10B981`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Error / Alert: Coral `#EF4444`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Text Primary: `#F9FAFB` | Text Secondary: `#9CA3AF`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Light Mode Palette**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Surface & Background: Clean Crisp White `#F8FAFC`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Cards: `#FFFFFF` with `#E2E8F0` outlines"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Primary Accent: Indigo `#4F46E5`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Text Primary: `#0F172A` | Text Secondary: `#64748B`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Typography & Ergonomics**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Prominent readable typography for Cyrillic and Latin scripts (Serbian uses both Cyrillic and Latin alphabets; support toggle or bilingual view)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - All interactive tiles and buttons adhere to a minimum 48dp \303\227 48dp touch target."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Lesson List**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Unlocked lessons display current dynamic score badge (e.g. `0.0`, `2.1`, `4.5`) or green checkmark when `masteryScore >= 4.5`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Locked lessons show a lock icon with disabled card state and indicator (e.g., *\"\320\242\321\200\320\265\320\261\321\203\320\265\321\202\321\201\321\217 \320\276\321\206\320\265\320\275\320\272\320\260 4.5 \320\262 \320\243\321\200\320\276\320\272\320\265 1\"*)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Lesson 1 is always unlocked."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Lesson Detail Screen**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Shows actual current lesson grade (e.g. `1.8 / 5.0`) and progress towards unlocking the next lesson (e.g., `36/100 \320\277\321\200\320\260\320\262\320\270\320\273\321\214\320\275\321\213\321\205 \320\276\321\202\320\262\320\265\321\202\320\276\320\262`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Sentence Construction Screen**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Word pool chips render strictly in lowercase (e.g., `\342\200\236\320\264\320\260\342\200\234`, `\342\200\236\320\273\320\270\342\200\234`, `\342\200\236\320\264\320\260\320\275\320\260\321\201\342\200\234`, `\342\200\236\321\200\320\260\320\264\320\270\321\210\342\200\234`, `\342\200\236\321\203\342\200\234`, `\342\200\236\320\272\320\260\320\275\321\206\320\265\320\273\320\260\321\200\320\270\321\230\320\270\342\200\234`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Distractor pool contains grammatical variants (different person/tense forms of verbs, case variants of nouns)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Answering correctly/incorrectly immediately updates the top counter and registers an answer in the 100-slot sliding window."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Vocabulary Drill Screen**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Each translation choice records into the lesson\'s answer history and updates the live grade."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Persistence Strategy via Room Database**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Use Room (SQLite) with pre-populated B1 Serbian curriculum and relational tables for Lessons, Vocabulary, Grammar Guides, Sentences, and Review Logs."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Room provides strict typing, lightning-fast reactive Flow queries, seamless offline operation, and rapid updates when importing external files."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Trade-off*: Fully offline and private to the device without requiring cloud authentication or network dependencies."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Comprehensive Multi-Format File Importer (JSON, CSV, XML)**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Build dedicated parsers for JSON (via Moshi/Kotlinx Serialization), CSV (buffered streaming), and XML (Android `XmlPullParser`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Language teachers and learners use different formats (Anki CSV exports, custom XML course packs, or structured JSON). Providing all three ensures zero friction."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Audio Architecture (TTS + File System URIs)**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: `AudioPlayerManager` that attempts to play local audio URI if specified; falls back gracefully to `TextToSpeech` with language locale configuration."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Guarantees pronunciation works out of the box on any device while offering high fidelity for custom audio files."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 4: Spaced Repetition Algorithm**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: An adapted SM-2 spaced repetition calculation storing `interval`, `repetitionCount`, `easeFactor`, and `dueDate`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Standardized and battle-tested for long-term vocabulary and grammar retention."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Persistent Rolling 100-Answer Window**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: A dedicated Room entity `LessonAnswerEntity` storing `(id, lessonId, isCorrect, timestamp)`. When a new answer is recorded, old answers beyond the last 100 for that lesson are pruned, and the lesson\'s `masteryScore` is recalculated and saved to `LessonEntity`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Ensures resilience across app restarts and exact compliance with the formula `(correct / 100) * 5.0`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Inner-Case Normalization**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Filter and transform all tokens via `.trim().lowercase().replace(Regex(\"[.,?!]\"), \"\")` before presenting them as chips. Punctuation is re-attached on assembly validation or ignored during syntactic equality check."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Eliminates the \"capital letter gives away first word\" loophole common in tile-based language apps."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 4. Technical Architecture & Component Structure"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
