  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Answer Logic**\n\nI\'m working on adding the logic to grade answers and unlock lessons within `CurriculumRepository.kt`. I\'m starting by inserting the answer data using a database call, including the lesson ID and whether it\'s correct. I\'m focusing on the `recordAnswer` function, ensuring it\'s efficient using `Dispatchers.IO`. I\'ll soon incorporate the unlocking logic after that.\n\n\n**Refining Grading System**\n\nI\'ve implemented the answer grading logic within `recordAnswer`. I\'m calculating a score based on the recent 100 answers, determining completion if it\'s over 4.5. Then, I\'m updating the lesson\'s grade statistics with the correct count, total count, and score. Finally, I\'m checking for lesson completion and unlocking the next lesson if the score threshold is met, updating the lesson database accordingly.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4573102556547584847"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.data.repository\\n\\nimport com.example.data.importer.ImportResult\\nimport com.example.data.local.AppDatabase\\nimport com.example.data.model.GrammarGuideEntity\\nimport com.example.data.model.LessonAnswerEntity\\nimport com.example.data.model.LessonEntity\\nimport com.example.data.model.SentenceEntity\\nimport com.example.data.model.SrsReviewEntity\\nimport com.example.data.model.VocabItemEntity\\nimport com.example.data.initial.InitialCurriculumData\\nimport com.example.srs.ReviewGrade\\nimport com.example.srs.SpacedRepetitionAlgorithm\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.Dispatchers\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.flow.Flow\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.flow.first\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.withContext\\n\\nclass CurriculumRepository(private val db: AppDatabase) {\\n    val allLessons: Flow<List<LessonEntity>> = db.lessonDao().getAllLessons()\\n\\n    fun getVocabForLesson(lessonId: String): Flow<List<VocabItemEntity>> =\\n        db.vocabDao().getVocabForLesson(lessonId)\\n\\n    suspend fun getVocabForLessonSync(lessonId: String): List<VocabItemEntity> =\\n        db.vocabDao().getVocabForLessonSync(lessonId)\\n\\n    fun getGrammarGuideForLesson(lessonId: String): Flow<GrammarGuideEntity?> =\\n        db.grammarDao().getGrammarGuideForLesson(lessonId)\\n\\n    fun getSentencesForLesson(lessonId: String): Flow<List<SentenceEntity>> =\\n        db.sentenceDao().getSentencesForLesson(lessonId)\\n\\n    fun getDueSrsItems(currentTimestamp: Long = System.currentTimeMillis()): Flow<List<SrsReviewEntity>> =\\n        db.srsDao().getDueItems(currentTimestamp)\\n\\n    fun getDueSrsCount(currentTimestamp: Long = System.currentTimeMillis()): Flow<Int> =\\n        db.srsDao().getDueCount(currentTimestamp)\\n\\n    suspend fun ensureInitialDataLoaded() = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n        val existing = db.lessonDao().getAllLessons().first()\\n        if (existing.isEmpty()) {\\n            val lessons = InitialCurriculumData.getInitialLessons()\\n            val vocab = InitialCurriculumData.getInitialVocab()\\n            val guides = InitialCurriculumData.getInitialGrammarGuides()\\n            val sentences = InitialCurriculumData.getInitialSentences()\\n\\n            db.lessonDao().insertLessons(lessons)\\n            db.vocabDao().insertVocabItems(vocab)\\n            db.grammarDao().insertGrammarGuides(guides)\\n            db.sentenceDao().insertSentences(sentences)\\n\\n            // Seed initial SRS cards from vocab\\n            val srsItems = vocab.mapIndexed { idx, v ->\\n                SrsReviewEntity(\\n                    id = v.id,\\n                    itemType = \\\"VOCAB\\\",\\n                    lessonId = v.lessonId,\\n                    prompt = v.targetWord,\\n                    answer = v.sourceTranslation,\\n                    secondaryText = v.targetWordLatin,\\n                    repetition = 0,\\n                    intervalDays = 1,\\n                    easeFactor = 2.5f,\\n                    nextReviewTimestamp = System.currentTimeMillis() - (idx * 60_000L) // Some due right away\\n                )\\n            }\\n            db.srsDao().insertAll(srsItems)\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    /**\\n     * Records an answer (right or wrong) for the given lesson.\\n     * Keeps the last 100 answers, calculates score = (correctCount / 100) * 5.0.\\n     * When score >= 4.5 (90+ correct out of 100), unlocks the next lesson.\\n     */\\n    suspend fun recordAnswer(lessonId: String, isCorrect: Boolean): Float = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n        // 1. Record answer in history\\n        db.lessonAnswerDao().insertAnswer(\\n            LessonAnswerEntity(lessonId = lessonId, isCorrect = isCorrect)\\n        )\\n\\n        // 2. Prune answers older than 100\\n        db.lessonAnswerDao().pruneOldAnswers(lessonId)\\n\\n        // 3. Calculate score based on last 100\\n        val recentAnswers = db.lessonAnswerDao().getRecentAnswers(lessonId, limit = 100)\\n        val correctCount = recentAnswers.count { it.isCorrect }\\n        val totalCount = recentAnswers.size\\n\\n        // Total count of right answers divided by 100 and multiplied by 5\\n        val score = (correctCount.toFloat() / 100f) * 5.0f\\n        val isCompleted = score >= 4.5f\\n\\n        db.lessonDao().updateGradeStats(\\n            id = lessonId,\\n            completed = isCompleted,\\n            score = score,\\n            correct = correctCount,\\n            total = totalCount\\n        )\\n\\n        // If grade is 4.5 or higher, unlock the next lesson\\n        if (isCompleted) {\\n            val current = db.lessonDao().getLessonById(lessonId)\\n            if (current != null) {\\n                db.lessonDao().unlockLessonByOrder(current.orderIndex + 1)\\n            }\\n        }\\n\\n        score\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun recordSrsResult(item: SrsReviewEntity, grade: ReviewGrade) = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n        val quality = SpacedRepetitionAlgorithm.gradeToQuality(grade)\\n        val updated = SpacedRepetitionAlgorithm.calculateNextReview(item, quality)\\n        db.srsDao().insertOrUpdate(updated)\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun enrollInSrs(vocab: VocabItemEntity) = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n        val existing = db.srsDao().getSrsItemById(vocab.id)\\n        if (existing == null) {\\n            val newItem = SrsReviewEntity(\\n                id = vocab.id,\\n                itemType = \\\"VOCAB\\\",\\n                lessonId = vocab.lessonId,\\n                prompt = vocab.targetWord,\\n                answer = vocab.sourceTranslation,\\n                secondaryText = vocab.targetWordLatin,\\n                repetition = 0,\\n                intervalDays = 1,\\n                easeFactor = 2.5f,\\n                nextReviewTimestamp = System.currentTimeMillis()\\n            )\\n            db.srsDao().insertOrUpdate(newItem)\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun importCurriculum(result: ImportResult) = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n        if (result.lessons.isNotEmpty()) {\\n            // Ensure first imported lesson is unlocked by default\\n            val adjusted = result.lessons.mapIndexed { idx, lesson ->\\n                lesson.copy(isUnlocked = if (idx == 0) true else lesson.isUnlocked, masteryScore = 0f)\\n            }\\n            db.lessonDao().insertLessons(adjusted)\\n        }\\n        if (result.vocabItems.isNotEmpty()) {\\n            db.vocabDao().insertVocabItems(result.vocabItems)\\n            val srsItems = result.vocabItems.map { v ->\\n                SrsReviewEntity(\\n                    id = v.id,\\n                    itemType = \\\"VOCAB\\\",\\n                    lessonId = v.lessonId,\\n                    prompt = v.targetWord,\\n                    answer = v.sourceTranslation,\\n                    secondaryText = v.targetWordLatin,\\n                    repetition = 0,\\n                    intervalDays = 1,\\n                    easeFactor = 2.5f,\\n                    nextReviewTimestamp = System.currentTimeMillis()\\n                )\\n            }\\n            db.srsDao().insertAll(srsItems)\\n        }\\n        if (result.grammarGuides.isNotEmpty()) {\\n            db.grammarDao().insertGrammarGuides(result.grammarGuides)\\n        }\\n        if (result.sentences.isNotEmpty()) {\\n            db.sentenceDao().insertSentences(result.sentences)\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun clearAndResetToDefaults() = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\\n        db.lessonDao().clearAll()\\n        ensureInitialDataLoaded()\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Add recordAnswer method to CurriculumRepository implementing 100-answer window and progression unblocking\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/repository/CurriculumRepository.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating CurriculumRepository.kt\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update CurriculumRepository\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\312\f\n\307\f\001i\024}\023\205>\211\022\354w\222\202\212E\036\021\356\213bp\262\360l\327\361c#\367\231\017Lg\270\330\254wn\203\v\233\356+\333\376f1\355v\335\v\264\277\032Z_\247]uN~\262\2158\256th\3349\374\315\n8\023@g\'b\234\204\365\257,\302Tv\274\226\3151I$\345\360\177\376\272\360\207 \327\217\261\334\276b\"\260{s\330m\215\231\300\315\236\306\226\235,\264\232\275\3015U\r\224\030\244\a,k\177\247B\326\274\006 \346\361O\203JxR\036\325\375\256&06)\3278Q\315\237\202\037\f\034}^)9)pX\362.t>\337\243\334.\372Uu\374t\t\004\311H\376\307\342\361j\337\3051i\227_\0177P\234M\274\016Ds\310p\202\353u\233\2413)[Jds\210(\320\034Y;\310k\212*Jd\271&\235i\220\272\366c/\017\314%\377\037\2429\377N\364\334}\205\315&\275\326\260\327D\216\261\251\312\360_diX7f\020W\310\274\302[\037\257`\345X \t\277\2249\2265\254\262\300n\036\247K\277!\213\203k\027\341\272>\2756\260\354DT\210\235\311g\323v\005\a\231\261\362\217\021m[\270\006]\341\033\337K\017zU\226\037=\257\030\274\305\207\f\244\n>\212a\305O\263_\244N;\335\233\017\030\302wp\241\026Zc\265\267q\276\035\2037?\276\333\346\365\031u`\341\327<Z2\030zgN# 4\017)\2505\223\340\235kW\306\332O;[z\277Od\2740\252\274\302H\246\306ok\024\037\2054\177\257\177\311,j\312\017\352\233\242K\004\233<{\301X\334\021\364\003X\360N\364Z\313\337\343\214\237W~\254\350\0229L\244\363\345)\316\312\237\315Nmf~r\273\025G\3209\261\347\351\265\232\237\'\025\356K\343\364\253\224\365\354\341\316\bU\311Y*\3165\373\320\324\002(-\352\314\006\237\266S\344\360XO9s\212BQ\374\367\360<[8\336,oy<]\262\224W\320\020\340\312\304\232O\301\352\221\036]\304\213\262\306\200>?\027\365B\321B\310\205\223\257\373\001\2058\027\017\274Rl(\240\315\366K\310\032\2030\016\344\367\341\333\3743i\335\334\020\314\346S\216\263\274\210\246\245\\2t\210o~ms\213\330?f\026\2217\201<M\215\271\210\"<\227\374f\bl\034KHi\362\026\377\205\352\364\204\023\3153Cr\017$>\321\223\233\240\b\355)\232\224\372\023\326M}i\375\261l\242B\030\352\252\215\260\005N\017\321\346Pw\001\024iK\265\330?\224?)\023\314EV\254\216~N\307{\313h\020\243\362#obM\370\347\2614\"$\360\021;\351\032]G\216\370o\363}\252\264[\212\207)\262\026\212!\030\275\370R\305pV\232[p\305\260\277\033\272\003\265\003\'1\375x\276,b\fY8\356\020)z\217;#\244\242\225\001c\322}\253\n`==\364BU\301\374\274\226\004\221\375\334\257\200e\360D\365\207\323\373h\262\257\276 %\210T\260\001@Y\3040!m(\372W\301\247\250\216R5\321H\302\275\225\267\350\fZT\300\277d\201l\037\240\277\255\246^\236\250@V\2072{n&^\351o\262E\235\334\331\236\357\202\316\244\252\367\230~u;(,\357\207\311R\260\313\353\\K\335\227b\343\373\270\036\334\306U\373O\364c\247\261)Dqf\322\273\006\026\246\'N\r\323\237\300t\034\223\364\a\t\301\242\353\366\320q\203\245\365\022\312$\246\352\200Z\220\207\3656\0256v\2253R\227%\201\216\365\350\346\257\246\216#\031\016O\304\242\350[V\337\233\362\263\276*\360\2670x\316\'\241\244\257\373\006\266\2057)\267\216|\004a\f\252\"\017\321H\210\375b9\241\177e7Kei\247\021\000\346\365<\251\343s\214\374\231g]i%+\2642\343\341\036\223R\213\303\232\346Gy8\035\r\320B\006\233Q\201\344\364\231\024\363\340r\264\333\000|\343e\333\235K\370:\016\024i]\301\000S\021\201\345\3223\246\020\217\322\244\254\200\223\275\223\307\210\344\263.\253!\017Y\'\245\364\247\345\300\247\373\000\214S\355\220\000\0370P:r.\204V\320\345\\\262\243\345\2273Kz\223}\353\vy\362u!\027(\020GA(?V\'\b\360\374Ow\231c\335\266Q\204\022l<\377\326\351\343\t\036\326\272\322\354$q\213F\021\302\233\022\224\341\250\311\336\227\305V\aKW@G\245\a4\322Gj\034\003\255\f\302\201:\036\237Lnu\026\356:\357\330J/>\334 \365\'}~Q\360#\2562\f\226}\315D\273\2412\377\315\357\230\372\b\262z{\027\207\307\311\034n\025np\323[KXl\306\367\023\347[\312kAs\232y\354\312nd\v\a\023\274\001\360\005\373\222\3358\333Xx\234\334X\024\033\347\361b\366\342\020\2609\203%\225\362JJ\nA)\035\006\304\034\b,A\271\352W\212y\263\352\377\213\016\342\366\036\255\375\230u\203\3773\302\205$\213~\202Q>+\021\2607i\354er.\275\023\'\003\370aS\032Okb\310\357\306\316\252\331G\206rO\325\357z\375:\345_}\034\357\220\2463\023\v\27