  planner_response {
    response: "### Summary of Implemented Fixes\n\n1. **Dynamic 100-Answer Grading System & Progression**:\n   - All lessons now initialize with a default grade of **`0.0`** (rather than hardcoded 4.5).\n   - Grade formula strictly follows: `(right_answers / 100) * 5.0`.\n   - The app maintains a rolling history of the **last 100 answers** per lesson across both Sentence Practice and Vocabulary Drills in the local Room database (`LessonAnswerEntity`).\n   - Right answers increase the grade; incorrect answers reduce it.\n   - Upon reaching **90 or more correct answers** in the 100-answer window (`grade >= 4.5`), the lesson is marked as mastered and **automatically unblocks the next lesson**.\n   - Locked lessons display a lock icon, indicate the prerequisite grade requirement (4.5 in preceding lesson), and prevent premature navigation.\n\n2. **Morphological Word Variants (Distractors)**:\n   - Word banks in Sentence Practice and choice grids in Vocabulary Drills now provide correct words along with plausible morphological variants (alternative persons, tenses, case endings, and verbal aspects).\n\n3. **Inner-Case (Lowercase) Word Bank Tiles**:\n   - All sentence practice word chips in the tile pool and assembly bay are standardized to **inner case (strictly lowercase)**.\n   - All punctuation (periods, question marks, commas, quotes) is stripped from individual chips so capital letters and punctuation no longer reveal sentence openers or closers."
    modified_response: "### Summary of Implemented Fixes\n\n1. **Dynamic 100-Answer Grading System & Progression**:\n   - All lessons now initialize with a default grade of **`0.0`** (rather than hardcoded 4.5).\n   - Grade formula strictly follows: `(right_answers / 100) * 5.0`.\n   - The app maintains a rolling history of the **last 100 answers** per lesson across both Sentence Practice and Vocabulary Drills in the local Room database (`LessonAnswerEntity`).\n   - Right answers increase the grade; incorrect answers reduce it.\n   - Upon reaching **90 or more correct answers** in the 100-answer window (`grade >= 4.5`), the lesson is marked as mastered and **automatically unblocks the next lesson**.\n   - Locked lessons display a lock icon, indicate the prerequisite grade requirement (4.5 in preceding lesson), and prevent premature navigation.\n\n2. **Morphological Word Variants (Distractors)**:\n   - Word banks in Sentence Practice and choice grids in Vocabulary Drills now provide correct words along with plausible morphological variants (alternative persons, tenses, case endings, and verbal aspects).\n\n3. **Inner-Case (Lowercase) Word Bank Tiles**:\n   - All sentence practice word chips in the tile pool and assembly bay are standardized to **inner case (strictly lowercase)**.\n   - All punctuation (periods, question marks, commas, quotes) is stripped from individual chips so capital letters and punctuation no longer reveal sentence openers or closers."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\200\002\n\375\001\001i\024}\023]\340\001*\323\317\332\343\001\346/\027vh\315\205$G\367\253*jO\317\036\341\242\312\254\030\370?-\375\004\201J:r$\301m\365\212 :W\246\374\006\314`\031*\346{\314{\317\272\231(\265\234?\023\021\350l\230\034\335GHf\342\236\221\235\203\260?6p\315\334\205\307\231\'\317pQ\303:Gi\201\326\276\220z*\310\324\344\307\217j@\035\246\312\247R\202]y`\263\033[\203\310\256\363\000\245\2534i\247\330\254@\305\020\250\341\020\202U\320\343\301\321<7;\246\3221\212X9\206\207\356\304s\317\302\2112\364\343N\214\327th\331\310\337\2673\216\231\323\001\203\217\226 \336\001\276\357\231Ih\016\225\263\334>\211\245\205\'H\245\267\2435W\373n\223r\363zp\017\032\324\t\264\v\272.\020\361y7\340m\310\017\225%\027\335\316IQ\a:\355\244P\244\360\201;\211rV"
